OL,3,GNEWSABraille device could remove
OL,4,Abarriers to science
OL,5,
OL,6,FA blind university lecturer says a new
OL,7,Fbraille device could help people with
OL,8,Fsight loss study and work in science,
OL,9,Ftechnology, engineering and maths
OL,10,F(STEM).
OL,12,FThe Canute Scientific has been created
OL,13,Fby Bristol Braille, a not-for-profit
OL,14,Fcompany that builds specialist
OL,15,Ftechnology with braille users.
OL,17,FDesigned to display complex scientific
OL,18,Fand mathematical information in
OL,19,Fbraille, it is hoped the device will
OL,20,Fhelp break down barriers for people
OL,21,Fpursuing STEM subjects and careers.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
