OL,3,GNEWSABraille device could remove
OL,4,Abarriers to science
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor Bath Spa University lecturer Hollie
OL,7,FBaker, the technology could make a
OL,8,Fsignificant difference. "It is
OL,9,Fessentially a computer, with a
OL,10,Fmulti-line braille display integrated
OL,11,Finto it," she said.
